---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="DST — AI, Crypto & Real Estate Ventures"
  description="DST builds and operates digital ventures across AI, Crypto, and Real Estate, starting in Dubai — the systems are ours; execution in each vertical runs through licensed local partners."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI · Crypto · Real Estate</p>
    <h1>We build the systems. Partners execute the vertical.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      DST is an operating group, not a single business. We design and run the
      digital infrastructure — sites, lead capture, CRM — behind ventures in
      three fast-moving spaces, and pair each one with a licensed local
      partner who handles the regulated, on-the-ground side. The first builds
      are live in Dubai.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="#portfolio">See the portfolio</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="portfolio" class="container">
    <h2>Portfolio</h2>
    <p>
      Shipped projects and what's currently in build — each on its own
      domain, with its own local execution partner where one applies.
    </p>
    <div class="venture-grid">
      <article class="card venture">
        <div class="venture-meta">
          <p class="eyebrow">Company formation</p>
          <span class="venture-status">Live</span>
        </div>
        <h3>llc.dst.llc</h3>
        <p>
          Free zones, mainland, banking, and the payment-processing
          questions software founders actually ask before they register.
        </p>
        <a class="venture-link" href="https://llc.dst.llc">Visit llc.dst.llc &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card venture">
        <div class="venture-meta">
          <p class="eyebrow">District guide</p>
          <span class="venture-status">Live</span>
        </div>
        <h3>riviera.dst.llc</h3>
        <p>
          A resident's guide to Azizi Riviera — coffee, food, pools, and
          where people actually swim, not what the listing photos show.
        </p>
        <a class="venture-link" href="https://riviera.dst.llc">Visit riviera.dst.llc &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card venture">
        <div class="venture-meta">
          <p class="eyebrow">Crypto</p>
          <span class="venture-status venture-status-progress">In development</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Crypto in the UAE</h3>
        <p>
          UAE crypto regulation and events, and the mechanics of buying
          property and other assets with digital currency.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="approach" class="container">
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p>
      The model is consistent across every vertical we open:
    </p>
    <ol class="approach-list">
      <li>
        <strong>We build the system.</strong> Content, site architecture, lead
        capture, and CRM routing — engineered for organic search rather than
        paid acquisition, so each site keeps earning traffic long after it
        ships.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>A local partner executes.</strong> We don't originate or
        close real estate deals, hold crypto on anyone's behalf, or practice
        regulated advice ourselves — licensed partners on the ground do that
        part, and we route qualified leads to them.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Each vertical compounds the network.</strong> Sites
        cross-link, share a design system, and point real, qualified traffic
        at each other — a visitor researching a Golden Visa is one click from
        the company-formation guide that half of them also need.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* .hero and .lede: shared in @dst/ui tokens.css. This page's hero is
     followed immediately by another section, so it adds bottom padding
     the shared default doesn't have. */
  .hero { padding-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); margin-top: var(--space-3); flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .venture-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
  .venture-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .venture-meta .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
  .venture-status {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ok);
    background: var(--ok-bg);
    padding: 0.15em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .venture-status-progress { color: var(--warn); background: var(--warn-bg); }
  .venture h3 { margin-top: var(--space-1); font-size: var(--step-1); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 600; }
  .venture-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: var(--space-2); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--step--1); }

  .approach-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .approach-list li { max-width: var(--content-width); }
</style>
